A simple and complete app for self-timer, continuous shooting and selfie, with grills, timer and adjustable intervals! 

Features: 
- Works on iPhone, iPad and iPod touch; 
- Timer first photo, adjustable from 0s to 120s; 
- Multiple shots, adjustable from 1 to 200; 
- Timer for multiple shots in sequence and adjustable from 2s to 120s; 
- Flash on, off, automatic; 
- Turn on the flashlight to illuminate the scene; 
- Beep sound for 5 seconds before each shot (can be disabled); 
- Auto-save in the photo gallery (can be disabled); 
- Three grids to better frame the scene (rule of thirds and the golden section); 
- Automatic recognition of faces; 
- Front and rear camera; 
- Digital Zoom; 
- Focus Automatic or manual; 
- Preview photos in high definition; 
- Share photos on social networks, or with your favorite applications, printing, copying, use as background Wallpaper! 


For information or suggestions, please use the Contact Us form in the Info menu of the application.

PicsExif is a minimalist photo information viewing and editing tool.

【Features】

- Support to delete GPS, Exif and other information;
- Support batch operation, multi-selection of the thumbnail page slide horizontally;
- Support viewing detailed parameters of photos;
- When viewing the big picture, shake it to save the parameters as a long screenshot;
- Support iPhone, iPad;
- Minimalist style, no in-app purchases, no ads;


If you like, you can introduce PicsExif to your friends as support.

【SCamera features】
1. Supports video mode for 4k video capture;
2. provide a widescreen (16:9), common (4:3), square (1:1) three photos proportional output of widescreen ultra for landscape;
3. high resolution photo output, photo detail visible, away from the residue definition;
4. fast auto-focus and auto-exposure, where the where;
5. very easy access to photo albums, supported a build to share favorite photos to the app, Facebook, QQ, Facebook, Twitter and other popular social networks;
6. support countdown pictures set 3/6 seconds/photo automatically after 12 seconds, giving you enough time to pose;
7. volume keys control, supported through the headset volume key pictures, free angle control;
8. print the date stamp, date can be marked in the right corner of the photo;
9. support the self-timer mode, supports face recognition;
10. Flash switch, can choose bright Flash under low light conditions;
11. friendly interface, easy, no cost of wood;
12. fit the latest iOS and iPhone;

Your support is our driving force of progress, if you have suggestions or comments can be posted in the comments, hope SCamera convenient to your life!
